{"unit_id":"JHboy203__dsh-plugin-catalog#feature-1","repo":"JHboy203/dsh-plugin-catalog","commit":"75745be11919b58625b82c91dcd765038cee551f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-catalog 的「本机扩展目录」功能：在侧栏集中显示插件、Skill 与 MCP 条目，并支持查看条目详情。打开插件面板即可浏览本机目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:20-29","client.js:5622-5625","lib/service.mjs:1047-1088"]}
{"unit_id":"JHboy203__dsh-plugin-catalog#feature-2","repo":"JHboy203/dsh-plugin-catalog","commit":"75745be11919b58625b82c91dcd765038cee551f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-catalog 的「调用统计」功能：汇总插件工具在会话日志中的调用次数、错误和最近使用情况，并在目录条目中显示统计字段。可从面板或 catalog_stats 工具查看。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/service.mjs:1047-1088","lib/tools.mjs:213-235"]}
{"unit_id":"JHboy203__dsh-plugin-catalog#feature-3","repo":"JHboy203/dsh-plugin-catalog","commit":"75745be11919b58625b82c91dcd765038cee551f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-catalog 的「标签与 AI 分类」功能：允许用户管理目录条目的标签，并调用分类能力为条目生成分类信息。用户可在面板交互或使用对应会话工具。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.mjs:279-310","lib/tools.mjs:367-382"]}
{"unit_id":"JHboy203__dsh-plugin-catalog#feature-4","repo":"JHboy203/dsh-plugin-catalog","commit":"75745be11919b58625b82c91dcd765038cee551f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-catalog 的「GitHub 备份规划」功能：为自写插件和 Skill 生成仓库发布计划；实际应用计划由单独调用触发。用户从发布面板或 catalog_publish 工具开始操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.mjs:426-450","lib/publish.mjs:86-105","lib/publish.mjs:290-300"]}
{"unit_id":"JHboy203__dsh-plugin-catalog#caveat-1","repo":"JHboy203/dsh-plugin-catalog","commit":"75745be11919b58625b82c91dcd765038cee551f","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-catalog 仅在用户明确执行发布操作时连接 GitHub 并传送所选插件备份内容；备份计划与实际应用分为两步。 (见 lib/publish.mjs:86-105, lib/publish.mjs:290-300)","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/publish.mjs:86-105","lib/publish.mjs:290-300"]}
